# Makepad Technical: a single-stroke technical sans, drawn for Makepad as
# centre lines on a grid (cap height 10, x-height 7, ascender 10.5,
# descender -3). Letters are spaced optically at layout, so the advances
# here are only the fallback for plain spacing.
font "Makepad Technical" em 14 cap 10 x 7 asc 10.5 desc -3 space 4.5

# Capitals
glyph A 10 : M 0 0 L 5 10 L 10 0 ; M 1.8 3.6 L 8.2 3.6
glyph B 9 : M 0 0 L 0 10 L 5.5 10 A 5.5 7.5 2.5 2.5 90 -90 L 0 5 ; M 0 5 L 6 5 A 6 2.5 2.5 2.5 90 -90 L 0 0
